1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,412
The decision was taken on the side of a shallow pool, with a board across two stones and a heavy drop of rain on the mat.

2
00:00:07,412 --> 00:00:12,876
“My plan is a habit, not an empire,” Maya said.

3
00:00:12,876 --> 00:00:27,594
“A quick look at the target tells you who is able to come.” A bar of shade, a pint of soup, and a lemon in the fruit bowl: the committee had provided lunch and nothing else.

4
00:00:27,594 --> 00:00:37,638
The acute problem was the stomach of a young athlete: a headache, a bulb of garlic, and a plate of potato and cucumber.

5
00:00:37,638 --> 00:00:42,417
“You cannot kick a body into health,” the doctor said.

6
00:00:42,417 --> 00:00:54,831
“You can hang a spoon from a fork, but you cannot hang a habit on a threat.” The salt, the cream, and the solid mass of the diet were all on the table.

7
00:00:54,831 --> 00:01:04,939
The triangle of obligations was simple: the national federation, the campus health service, and our own small project.

8
00:01:04,939 --> 00:01:09,629
“Follow the body and the bank will follow,” she said.

9
00:01:09,629 --> 00:01:24,487
“Kill the pressure and you kill the plan.” The review of the last month showed a fall in injuries and a rise in attendance, and the crown of the argument was a story about a naked skater on the ice.

10
00:01:24,487 --> 00:01:32,966
The decision was to make rest a formal part of training, with a mat, a mixer, and a pump in the corner of the gym.

11
00:01:32,966 --> 00:01:37,320
“An incline is not a barrier,” the coach said.

12
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:50,748
“It is a slower way up.” A nickel in the vending machine, a pair of pants in the locker, and a filling in a tooth: the small costs of a large change.

13
00:01:50,748 --> 00:02:00,457
They came to the committee with one sentence and one number: two hours a week, provided free, for every member of the club.

14
00:02:00,457 --> 00:02:06,011
The committee asked who would pay, and the answer was our own budget line.

15
00:02:06,011 --> 00:02:09,411
“Who loses?” the chair asked.

16
00:02:09,411 --> 00:02:25,099
“Nobody who is able to come,” Maya said, “and that is the whole point.” The decision was difficult, and it had to come today; the committee would ask who paid, and my answer was the same as theirs.

17
00:02:25,099 --> 00:02:34,762
Able bodies, a bank, a national register: the plan had to provide something that could reach a body before it broke.

18
00:02:34,762 --> 00:02:48,047
A shoulder, an apple, a skate, and a music stand: the room had everything except a programme for an addict of busyness, and the game would be lost without one.
